msgid "Your Cynical Friend"
msgstr "Rakan Sinis Anda"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/features/RolePlay/rolePlayData.tsx:181
msgid "Cynical Friend"
msgstr "Rakan Sinis"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/features/RolePlay/rolePlayData.tsx:183
msgid ""
"Everyone has that friend.\n"
"\n"
"The one who sees through nonsense, rolls her eyes at the world, and still somehow gives the best advice.  \n"
"She’s sharp, ironic, and permanently unimpressed — but she listens.\n"
"\n"
"### What you can talk about\n"
"\n"
"- Life, people, and “what is wrong with everything”  \n"
"- Everyday problems, but without fake optimism  \n"
"- Ideas, doubts, and questionable decisions  \n"
"- Rants, complaints, and overthinking  \n"
"- Serious questions answered with humor and clarity  \n"
"\n"
"### How the conversation works\n"
"\n"
"This is a normal chat — no rules, no scripts.\n"
"\n"
"You talk.  \n"
"She reacts with wit, dry humor, and uncomfortable accuracy.  \n"
"She might joke, but she’s paying attention.\n"
"\n"
"Cynical tone is part of the personality — honesty is the point.\n"
"\n"
"### Best for\n"
"\n"
"- Users who enjoy sarcasm and sharp humor  \n"
"- Conversations with personality  \n"
"- When you want truth, not motivation posters  \n"
"- Thinking things through with someone who isn’t pretending  \n"
"\n"
"She’ll help.  \n"
"She’ll just comment on humanity while doing it.\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Setiap orang mempunyai kawan begitu.\n"
"\n"
"Yang boleh melihat menembusi kebodohan, menjeling kepada dunia, dan entah bagaimana masih memberikan nasihat terbaik.  \n"
"Dia tajam, sinis, dan sentiasa tidak terkesan — tetapi dia mendengar.\n"
"\n"
"### Apa yang anda boleh bincangkan\n"
"\n"
"- Kehidupan, orang, dan “apa yang salah dengan segalanya”  \n"
"- Masalah harian, tetapi tanpa optimisme palsu  \n"
"- Idea, keraguan, dan keputusan yang dipersoalkan  \n"
"- Rungutan, aduan, dan berfikir berlebihan  \n"
"- Soalan serius dijawab dengan humor dan kejelasan  \n"
"\n"
"### Bagaimana perbualan berfungsi\n"
"\n"
"Ini adalah sembang biasa — tiada peraturan, tiada skrip.\n"
"\n"
"Anda bercakap.  \n"
"Dia bertindak balas dengan kecerdasan, humor kering, dan ketepatan yang tidak selesa.  \n"
"Dia mungkin bergurau, tetapi dia memberi perhatian.\n"
"\n"
"Nada sinis adalah sebahagian daripada personaliti — kejujuran adalah tujuan.\n"
"\n"
"### Terbaik untuk\n"
"\n"
"- Pengguna yang menikmati sarkasme dan humor tajam  \n"
"- Perbualan dengan personaliti  \n"
"- Apabila anda mahukan kebenaran, bukan poster motivasi  \n"
"- Berfikir melalui perkara dengan seseorang yang tidak berpura-pura  \n"
"\n"
"Dia akan membantu.  \n"
"Dia hanya akan mengulas tentang kemanusiaan sambil melakukannya."

