#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/features/Landing/LandingPage.tsx:278
msgid "Improving your English speaking skills takes time and consistent practice. FluencyPal is designed for learners who can already communicate at least a little and want to become more fluent, confident, and accurate through regular speaking practice. Progress is usually gradual, and many users improve by around 5% over a month of steady practice."
